        "biography": "",
        "appearance": "",
        "notes": "<h5>Tactics</h5><p>Rather than getting involved in a conflict directly, an <strong>advisor</strong> uses their abilities to support their clients. The advisor’s Timely Advice feature makes them a valuable companion in a conversation, while their At Your Service action can anticipate the needs of their client in combat. Advisors are particularly effective alongside Metalborn clients, enabling the Metalborn to save actions when using Drink Vial to refill their Investiture. Otherwise, advisors spend the remainder of their focus to offer Timely Advice, then Recover to regain focus.</p>",
        "role": "minion"
    },
